    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the job losses part seems like the biggest risk though. wouldn't the disruption to the coal and oil industries basically create a massive economic vacuum in those regions that the \"green jobs\" won't be able to fill quickly enough? it feels like a recipe for a huge recession in the heartland.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
