      "content": "exactly. and if you look at the sheer scale of the spending required to fix that, it's basically going to lead to massive debt and inflation. it seems like a pretty fundamentally flawed economic model if the \"solution\" to job loss is just more massive government spending that ends up devaluing the currency. isn't it more realistic to say this policy is just an economic disaster waiting to happen?",
